strata verify: window up to 5 tokens, 70.2 MiB of device buffers
strata serve: conversation cache: RAM ceiling 512 MiB (parked snapshots plus the retained K/V); a snapshot over it parks to disk only, and over it the least recently active conversations the disk tier published drop to disk (the active conversation is never dropped)
strata serve: conversation cache: file page-cache release ON (park writes, restore reads and ring sidecars hand their cached pages back after their flush; the parked file's page-cache footprint stays ~0)
strata serve: conversation cache: disk tier ON at /mnt/srcds/Strata-wt-helper-ipc/run/diet-soak-cache (direct I/O, budget 24576 MiB): generations=4 bytes=7028 sidecars=2 orphan temps=0 orphan sidecars=0 corrupt=0 foreign=0
strata serve: foresight swap: slots per layer per card: card0:2, card1:8 on 2 card(s), up to 32 copies per card and window, admit after 2 miss(es), reuse after 4 windows, helper shadow ON (a landed slot serves a helper-held pair), 16-entry pinned staging ring
strata serve: STRATA_ROUTE_TAIL_SKIP=7 is suspended: a helper expert tier is registered and the skip would zero its rows; STRATA_TAIL_SKIP_HELPER=1 skips only the misses no tier holds (the CPU-bound ones), exactly a rig without a helper
strata serve: adaptive overlap: off: not on a layer split
